  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From God To Man Rice Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From God to Man is a group of 50 farmers who produce rice in Doumpa County in Nimba District of Liberia. The project will focus on adding value to their product by beginning to parboil rice. Funds will be used to purchase equipment, get access to working capital and provide training in cooperative capacity building including financial management, organizational development, marketing, and cooperative governance.</narrative>
  </description>
